held={'PH01':'Unchanged live schematic. Original Built/Komatsu candidate rejected. R1/R2 await final visual approval.', 'PH03':'Schematic retained: original shows JCB marks; Pexels detailed terms §5 prohibits commercial branded-content use in relation to goods/services. No separate permission verified.', 'PH04':'Schematic retained by explicit instruction. No permission requested.', 'PH06':'Schematic retained by explicit instruction. No permission requested.', 'PH09':'Schematic retained: Blaw-Knox marks and recognizable workers; trademark/release permissions unverified. No substitute silently selected.'}
